fter escaping hell and travel  through the wild Serpent's belly we end  up back in midgard for our final  encounter with Boulder it begins with  him being stabbed by atreus using  mistletoe the only thing that can break  the spell placed on him by his mother  making him vulnerable again when given  the choice to kill baldir Kratos spares  him the lesson he was trying to teach  atreus with Modi however Kratos has no  choice when Boulder tries to kill his  mother freyja he intervenes and just  like their first encounter he snaps his  neck only this time Boulder does die his  last word being snow a reference to  thimble winter the great winter that  comes before Ragnarok Kratos and atreus  have now made an enemy of freyja Kratos  and atreus can finally climb the top of  the highest peak in yotenheim and  Scatter the ashes as promised however  before they do they uncover a rather  interesting prophecy markings on the  wall that show the entire story so far  kratos's wife was a giant making atreus  half giant himself we also see a carving  that shows what many believe to be  kratos's death or some kind of  transference of energy Kratos and  atreyas Scatter the ashes together in a  very heartwarming end just before the  game ends we get the absolute bombshell  dropped on us that the name the Giants  have for atreus and the name his mother  wanted when he was born is Loki  today's video has been made possible by  wandrium for those who are new wandrium  has joined forces with a Great Courses  plus to create a bigger better and more  immersive educational experience than  before there are thousands of lectures  documentaries courses and videos for  everyone the ever-growing library means  there are always new topics whether  you're looking for a quick how-to or  just some mind-blowing facts you can  learn at the pace that suits you best in  the comfort of your own home on pretty  much any device a one dream series I've  recently watched is the secrets of the  occult now thi